handle_spacex.name}, {handle_nvda.name}\\\")\\n```\\n\\n### Plan:\\n1. **Spawned Workers**:\\n   - `btc-investigator`: Investigating expert forecasts and price target ranges for BTC through year-end.\\n   - `spacex-investigator`: Investigating SpaceX valuation estimates, tender offers, and key operational/financial milestones.\\n   - `nv\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],\"en\",null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"New York, USA\",\"SWML_DESCRIPTION_FROM_YOUR_INTERNET_ADDRESS\",false,null,\"//www.google.com/maps/vt/data\\u003dnMCg6iXdxG1_9Y-3lxBgMNf7XktAf8ZikRF5SnVH3vemy3DurJSvkwEbDMwev76f3w1JmQD38qqs0eDts6aKehzMBURQmjpRwyWFtTuLcbvivWab9VVGKDLxGwr_YqVuH5Oum-2eR4Tvs5ng-X5L6VowUexzlmWGfN5hX4B4sON4TvQKbh_LZ9RT78BgMQ21\"],null,null,\"US\",null,null,null,null,null,false,null,null,null,null,\"en\",null,null,null,true,[null,[false,false,true],[false,true,false,false,false,false],false,[[[\"Academic - Other\",2.8553483E-4],[\"Coding\",0.009328305],[\"Creative - Other\",9.056126E-4],[\"Creative Writing\",6.8436045E-4],[\"Customer Support\",8.046482E-6],[\"Daily Life Expert - Other\",9.341661E-4],[\"Daily Life Personal - Other\",8.2670257E-4],[\"Data Analysis\",0.0013834573],[\"Emotional Support\",6.558782E-4],[\"Engagement - Other\",0.0070254905],[\"Events\",8.7734436E-5],[\"Finance / Accounting\",3.772423E-4],[\"Fitness\",1.399051E-5],[\"Games\",0.006087341],[\"General Info Seeking\",0.05711899],[\"Government / Law\",3.2209425E-4],[\"HR / Career Management\",1.9748363E-4],[\"Health\",0.010035012],[\"Life Organizer\",0.0017719782],[\"Lifelong Learning\",0.006772993],[\"Marketing \\u0026 Advertising\",9.5228126E-5],[\"Meals / Nutrition\",0.0022742178],[\"Media / Entertainment\",0.0020692043],[\"Multimodal Generation\",0.0059165126],[\"News / Status\",0.0030818882],[\"Personal Finance\",0.0013470363],[\"Professional - Other\",0.002301553]