[["wrb.fr",null,"[null,[\"c_ce74fffdc08c1151\",\"r_fa166f2c8ef318ac\"],null,null,[[\"rc_f00ec7ea92b3ada9\",[\"I will spawn three independent subagents using the RLM subagent orchestration system to investigate year-end predictions for Bitcoin (BTC), SpaceX (valuation/outlook), and NVIDIA (NVDA).\\n\\nLet's launch the three subagents.\\n\\n```python\\n# Spawn 3 subagents for BTC, SpaceX, and NVIDIA\\nbtc_prompt \\u003d (\\n    \\\"Research and summarize expert predictions and price targets for Bitcoin (BTC) by the end of this year. \\\"\\n    \\\"Include bull cases, bear cases, consensus estimates, and major institutional forecasts. \\\"\\n    \\\"When finished, send your detailed summary back to parent via `await agent_message.send(message, receiver_role\\u003d'parent')`.\\\"\\n)\\n\\nspacex_prompt \\u003d (\\n    \\\"Research and summarize expert financial analysis, private market valuation predictions, tender offer data, \\\"\\n    \\\"and milestone projections (e.g. Starship, Starlink IPO or revenue expectations) for SpaceX by the end of this year. \\\"\\n    \\\"When finished, send your detailed summary back to parent via `await agent_message.send(message, receiver_role\\u003d'parent')`.\\\"\\n)\\n\\nnvda_prompt \\u003d (\\n    \\\"Research and summarize Wall Street analyst and market expert predictions, target prices, and revenue/datacenter growth expectations \\\"\\n    \\\"for NVIDIA (NVDA) by the end of this year. \\\"\\n    \\\"Include consensus target prices, bull/bear ranges, and key catalysts. \\\"\\n    \\\"When finished, send your detailed summary back to parent via `await agent_message.send(message, receiver_role\\u003d'parent')`.\\\"\\n)\\n\\nhandle_btc \\u003d await rlm.spawn(btc_prompt, name\\u003d\\\"btc-investigator\\\")\\nhandle_spacex \\u003d await rlm.spawn(spacex_prompt, name\\u003d\\\"spacex-investigator\\\")\\nhandle_nvda \\u003d await rlm.spawn(nvda_prompt, name\\u003d\\\"nvda-investigator\\\")\\n\\nprint(f\\\"Spawned: {handle_btc.name}, {handle_spacex.name}, {handle_nvda.name}\\\")\\n```\\n\\n### Plan:\\n1. **Spawned Workers**:\\n   - `btc-investigator`: Investigating expert forecasts and price target ranges for BTC through year-end.\\n   - `spacex-investigator`: Investigating SpaceX valuation estimates, tender offers, and key operational/financial milestones.\\n   - `nvda-investigator`: Investigating Wall Street analyst consensus targets, hardware roadmap (e.g. Blackwell/AI demand), and bull/bear scenarios for NVDA.\\n\\n2. **Next Steps**:\\n   - As each agent finishes its independent research and sends its report back via direct parent messaging, I will synthesize and organize their findings into a cohesive year-end outlook report for you.\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],\"en\",null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"New York, USA\",\"SWML_DESCRIPTION_FROM_YOUR_INTERNET_ADDRESS\",false,null,\"//www.google.com/maps/vt/data\\u003dnMCg6iXdxG1_9Y-3lxBgMNf7XktAf8ZikRF5SnVH3vemy3DurJSvkwEbDMwev76f3w1JmQD38qqs0eDts6aKehzMBURQmjpRwyWFtTuLcbvivWab9VVGKDLxGwr_YqVuH5Oum-2eR4Tvs5ng-X5L6VowUexzlmWGfN5hX4B4sON4TvQKbh_LZ9RT78BgMQ21\"],null,null,\"US\",null,null,null,null,null,false,null,null,null,null,\"en\",null,null,null,true,[null,[false,false,true],[false,true,false,false,false,false],false,[[[\"Academic - Other\",2.8553483E-4],[\"Coding\",0.009328305],[\"Creative - Other\",9.056126E-4],[\"Creative Writing\",6.8436045E-4],[\"Customer Support\",8.046482E-6],[\"Daily Life Expert - Other\",9.341661E-4],[\"Daily Life Personal - Other\",8.2670257E-4],[\"Data Analysis\",0.0013834573],[\"Emotional Support\",6.558782E-4],[\"Engagement - Other\",0.0070254905],[\"Events\",8.7734436E-5],[\"Finance / Accounting\",3.772423E-4],[\"Fitness\",1.399051E-5],[\"Games\",0.006087341],[\"General Info Seeking\",0.05711899],[\"Government / Law\",3.2209425E-4],[\"HR / Career Management\",1.9748